      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smithville%2C_Arkansas"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The eastern third of Smithville is a low‑lying area prone to flooding from Machine Creek.",
